      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start but i feel like the libertarian section is a bit thin compared to the social democracy part. can u go deeper into the libertarian side? like, what are some of the more complex arguments they make regarding how taxation affects social contracts or individual agency, beyond just the \"theft\" argument? i want to make sure i'm not just painting them as one-dimensional.",
